    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olng'ura le Nkai te Siraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHP.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilf 3.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naikilikuanu naa ajo, keidipa ninye Enkai atanya ltung'ana lenyena? Mme neijia pae! Ara nanu makewan Osiraeli, ole ishoi e Abraham, ole ntalipa o losho le Benchamen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eitu eany Enkai ltung'ana lenyena laa ninche apake etayiolo, Aimiyiololo enajo Ilkigerot te Eliya o ina natasayia Enkai agilunore Isiraeli ejo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.19.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Int 19.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.19.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Olaitoriani, etara ninche iloibonok linono metuata, eturoitie lperereni loo lasarri linono, nanu ake openy otelekua, naa enkishui ai taata eing'oru.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.19.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Int 19.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ketawalikia ninye Enkai ajoki aa? “Atelekaka kewan ilewa oora inkalifuni naapishana leitu egilaki kung Baal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neijia sii taata etiu keetae olpisiai, laa te mpiris egeluno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake te naa te mpiris nemeekure aa too nkiasin amu meitoki naa empiris aaku empiris.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ainyoo naa? Siraeli leitu etum ina apa naing'oru ninche. Nenoto ninche lelo oogeluno, kake neitiming'ani lelo kulikae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.29.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 29.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.29.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 29.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " anaa enatisiraki aajo, “Eishoo Enkai ninche ltauja o lukuny nemening'u toki o nkonyek nemedolisho o nkiyaa ometabaiki ena olong, nemening'isho o te ne.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.69.22+PSA.69.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Olke 69.22-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejo Daudi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naikilikuanu naa ajo, amaa, amu etabatatate Ilyahudi teine metaa meekure esarunoyu? Mme neijia pae! Kake enkaraki natagolo onyek pee eewuo enjeunoto Loreren, peyie epiki Siraeli olom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaa te nenyaaka taata engolon enye oo nkonyek aaku enkarsisisho too loreren, naa amaa te netaa ina natalaikinote ninche naitaa Iloreren karsisi, kebaa kenya elusoo ina nayau emborei e ning'oto te nening'ishoyu ninye!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enjeunoto oo loreren",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore taata, intae Iloreren airorie. Naa enkaraki nara nanu olkipaaret oirriwakaki Iloreren, esiaai ai aitasapuk ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "peyie atumoki atipika Ilyahudi lang olom, pee ebaiki neitajeu ina kulikae lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu te naa ina natanyaita ninche nayaka enkop metoning'ore Enkai, keeta ae nayau enyorrarroto enye neme empiunoto too lootuata? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te nesinya eoroti e nkurma naipurji naiteri aaisho Enkai aaitaa ilng'anayio ooiteruni aatum, nesinya sii ninye enkae lulung'ata pooki; naa te nesinya entonai, nesinya sii ninche ilng'osil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake amaa te netigiluaki kulikae ng'osil, ore iyie olng'osila lo loirien le ntim, nikirubakini ine netigilunyeki pee king'arieki ina arsisisho e ilo oirien, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimiwuasa naa ake ti alo lelo kulikae ng'osil. Naa ti niwuasa, tadamu tejo mme iyie doi onapita ina tonai, kake ina tonai nikinapita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa iyie oyooki ajo, “Etigiluaki ilng'osil peyie aarubakini nanu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nesipa ina. Etigiluaki enkaraki neitu eiruk, kake te nkirukoto ake sii pee intashe iyie. Metaa miwuasa ake iyie, kake tureisho intashe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu te neitu eingurrie Enkai ilng'osil ate le ilo shani, mikiduaaya sii ninye iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toduaa naa olng'ur o empijan e Nkai, ina pijan enye te lelo ootabatatate, kake ore olng'ur le Nkai, tenebik tiatua, te neme neijia nikidung'ori sii ninye iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore sii ninche lelo kulikae, te neibelekenya aapal ina neitu eiruk, kerubakini sii ninche, amu keeta Enkai engolon naitoki arubakinye ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ti nikitudung'uoki to loirien le ntim, nikipuonunui aarubaki oloirien oramati, kebaa naa etumoki lelo ng'osil le ilo oirien oramati enkibung'ata einyakuaki oloirien openy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olng'ur le Nkai too ltung'ana pooki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
